<title>POLAND: PROCHNIK OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.7.</title>
<headline>PROCHNIK OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.7.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.66 vs   0.62</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.25 vs   1.29</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.49 vs   1.60</p>
<p> Sales		   11.14 vs   9.87</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.58 vs   1.81</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.17 vs   2.82</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.99 vs   4.82</p>
<p> Sales		   50.57 vs  47.50</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Prochnik SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
